<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to tender Friday for 54,000T U.S. soybeans.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to tender Friday for 54,000T U.S. soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association's Kaohsiung division said on Thursday it will tender on Friday for one 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans.</p>
<p>The BSPA Kaohsiung division comprises Great Wall Enterprise, President Enterprise, Ttet Union and Tai Hwa Oil.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>				U.S. Gulf	  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>    One	54,000     March 16-30	April 1-15</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
